'''The Greenhouse''' (Japanese: '''緑の館''' ''Green House'') is an {{pkmn|animated series}}-exclusive location in [[Hoenn]]. It is a {{OBP|Pokémon|species}} aromatherapy laboratory located between [[Mauville City]] and [[Fallarbor Town]]. It appeared in ''[[AG047|I Feel Skitty!]]''.

At The Greenhouse, fragrances are used to heal Pokémon. They make the fragrances from {{m|Sweet Scent}}s from Pokémon such as {{p|Oddish}} and {{p|Weepinbell}}, which they then mix with all kinds of herbs to create medicine. Besides a laboratory, The Greenhouse has a large garden designed to keep the resident {{t|Grass}} Pokémon happy. The leading therapist and director of The Greenhouse is [[Eliza]].

When {{Ash}} and {{ashfr}} found an ill {{TP|May|Skitty}}, {{an|Brock}} came up with the idea to take it to The Greenhouse, which was nearby. Brock happened to know of the facility because he had seen an infomercial on it. When they arrived, Eliza accepted their request to heal Skitty and took them on a tour. After explaining her work, Eliza proceeded to examine Skitty and concluded that it was in fact fatigued. Inhaling one of Eliza's scents, Skitty quickly felt better.

{{an|May}} then challenged Skitty to a battle inside the laboratory, as she wanted to {{pkmn2|caught|catch}} it. However, the capture attempt was interrupted by {{TRT}}, who stole many of the facility's fragrances with help of {{TP|Jessie|Seviper}}'s {{m|Haze}}. Eventually, Team Rocket was found and defeated, and the stolen fragrances were safely returned to The Greenhouse.

